.TH LIBMPQ__ARCHIVE_OFFSET 3 2026-08-12 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__archive_offset \- return the archive offset in the backing file.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B
#include <libmpq/mpq.h>
.sp
.BI "int32_t libmpq__archive_offset("
.BI "        mpq_archive_s  *" "mpq_archive",
.BI "        libmpq__off_t *" "offset"
.BI ");"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Call \fBlibmpq__archive_offset\fP() to get the archive's absolute byte offset in the backing file.
.LP
The first argument is an archive handle opened by
\fBlibmpq__archive_open\fP(). The function stores the offset in \fIoffset\fP.
.SH RETURN VALUE
On success, a zero is returned.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libmpq__file_offset (3),
